
📁 PROJECT: My Dukan (Flutter Android App)

🎯 App Ka Maqsad

Ek professional dukaan (Kirana/Wholesaler) ke liye billing aur hisaab-kitab wali app. Isme Bill Book, Stock, Khata (Cash), aur Staff management sab kuch hai. Har user apni Email ID se login karega. (PWA se inspired hai, ab Flutter mein convert kar rahe hain).

🛠️ Tech Stack

· Framework: Flutter (Dart)
· Database: SQLite (sqflite package)
· Build System: GitHub Actions (Mobile se APK build karne ke liye)
· GitHub Repo: vasim1234/Bill-Book-App
· Packages Used: sqflite, path, url_launcher, qr_flutter

🗄️ Database Structure (Version 7)

(File: lib/database_helper.dart)

1. users: id, email, password (Login ke liye)
2. bills: id, customerName, customerMobile, totalAmount, date, paymentStatus
3. bill_items: id, billId, itemName, quantity, price
4. items (Stock): id, itemName, price, stock
5. customers: id, name, mobile
6. transactions (Cash): id, customerId, amount, type (LIYA/DIYA), note, date
7. settings: id, businessName, ownerName, mobile, address, upiId, theme, gst, businessType
8. staff: id, name, mobile, dailyWage
9. attendance: id, staffId, date, status (Present/Absent), paymentStatus
10. staff_payments: id, staffId, amount, note, date

📱 App Ka Structure (Screens & Files)

1. lib/main.dart: App ka main entry point. AuthScreen (Login) se shuru hota hai. Login ke baad MainNavigationScreen khulti hai jisme BottomNavigationBar hai (Cash, Stock, Quick, Staff). Yahan FAB (Cart button) se AddBillScreen khulta hai.
2. lib/auth_screen.dart: Login aur Signup ka UI. Local database se email/password check karta hai.
3. lib/cash_screen.dart (Khata): Customers ki list, Total Lena/Dena ka summary. Naya customer aur transaction add karne ka popup. Customer par click karne se CustomerDetailScreen khulti hai.
4. lib/customer_detail_screen.dart: Ek customer ka pura hisaab. Edit customer, Report, WhatsApp Reminder, aur "Aapne Diye / Aapne Liye" ka button.
5. lib/stock_screen.dart: Dukaan ke items ki list. Total Stock Value aur This Month Sale ka dashboard. Item Edit aur IN/OUT ka option.
6. lib/add_item_screen.dart: Naya stock item add karne ka form.
7. lib/edit_item_screen.dart: Purane item ko edit karne ka form.
8. lib/staff_screen.dart: Staff ki list, Present/Absent summary, Naya staff add, aur Haazri lagane ka popup.
9. lib/staff_detail_screen.dart: Staff ki detail, Pagar Bani, Paise Diye, Haazri history, Advance/Pagar dene ka option.
10. lib/add_bill_screen.dart: Naya bill banane ka screen. Customer details, Multi-item cart (Bill Tally), Payment status (UNPAID/CASH/UPI). Save karne par BillPreviewScreen par bhejta hai.
11. lib/bill_preview_screen.dart: Bill ka professional print preview. 3 themes hain (Modern Boxed, Classic Minimal, Dark Header). QR Code generate karta hai aur WhatsApp par bill bhejta hai.
12. lib/settings_screen.dart: Sidebar (Drawer). Business Name, GST, UPI ID, Bill Theme, Business Type set karne ke liye.

